# "Save As" duplicates (macOS text editors create these when
# "Save As" is used to write a copy of a tracked file). They
# pollute `git status` and are never intentional source files.
# Pattern matches "foo 2.py", "foo 3.py", "bar 2.md", etc.
* 2.*
* 3.*
